---
// site/src/components/home/HomeAbout.astro
---
<section class="home-about block-about" data-home-about aria-labelledby="home-about-heading">
	<h2 id="home-about-heading" class="visually-hidden">About</h2>
	<div class="home-about__wrapper about-wrapper">
		<figure class="home-about__figure image" data-home-about-image>
			<img src="/images/home/girl.jpg" alt="lady madrid" width="640" height="960" loading="lazy" />
		</figure>
		<div class="home-about__text intro-text">
			<p data-home-about-p>I'm <strong>Juanma Perez</strong>, a web developer from Seville and based in London.</p>
			<p data-home-about-p>I build blazing fast and high perfomance websites or apps based on the most modern technologies.</p>
			<p data-home-about-p>I love Javascript and all the frameworks related to this language such as React, Angular or Vue.</p>
			<p data-home-about-p>As a freelance I work with companies, agencies, startups and individuals all around the world.</p>
			<p data-home-about-p><a class="home-about__read-more" href="/cv">Read more.</a></p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.home-about {
		min-height: 100vh;
		padding-top: 100px;
		background: #fbf9f3;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 100%;
		box-sizing: border-box;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
	}
	.home-about__wrapper {
		background: #fbf9f3;
		position: relative;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 100%;
		clip-path: inset(0 0 0 0);
	}
	.home-about__figure {
		position: fixed;
		right: 120px;
		bottom: 10px;
		width: 32vw;
		margin: 0;
		z-index: 1;
	}
	.home-about__figure.is-pinned {
		position: absolute;
	}
	.home-about__figure img {
		display: block;
		max-width: 100%;
		height: auto;
	}
	.home-about__text {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 10;
		width: 75%;
		font-size: 6vw;
		color: #323846;
		line-height: 1.2;
		padding: 100vh 120px 50px;
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}
	.home-about__text p {
		mix-blend-mode: difference;
		margin: 0 0 100px;
		font-weight: bolder;
	}
	.home-about a:focus-visible {
		outline: 2px solid currentColor;
		outline-offset: 2px;
	}
	@media (max-width: 1080px) {
		.home-about {
			padding-top: 200px;
			min-height: 400px;
		}
		.home-about__text {
			padding: 20px;
			font-size: 9vw;
		}
		.home-about__text p {
			margin-bottom: 80px;
		}
		.home-about__figure {
			right: 70px;
			bottom: 35px;
			width: 60vw;
		}
	}
	@media (max-width: 1024px) {
		.home-about__text {
			width: 85%;
		}
		.home-about__text p {
			font-size: 9vw;
		}
	}
	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.home-about {
			padding-top: 200px;
			min-height: 400px;
		}
		.home-about__text {
			width: 85%;
			font-size: 9vw;
		}
		.home-about__text p {
			margin-bottom: 50px;
		}
	}
	@media (max-width: 480px) {
		.home-about {
			padding-top: 120px;
		}
		.home-about__text {
			padding: 10px;
			font-size: 9vw;
		}
		.home-about__text p {
			margin-bottom: 40px;
		}
		.home-about__text p strong {
			color: #323846;
		}
		.home-about__figure {
			right: 20px;
			width: 70vw;
		}
	}
	.visually-hidden {
		position: absolute;
		width: 1px;
		height: 1px;
		padding: 0;
		margin: -1px;
		overflow: hidden;
		clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
		white-space: nowrap;
		border: 0;
	}
</style>
